## 24. Major Challenges Identified

The paper identifies several challenges that must be considered when developing healthcare AI.

### Bias

A model trained on unrepresentative data may produce unequal performance.

### Privacy

Women's health data is sensitive and requires appropriate security.

### Regulation

Medical AI systems may fall under healthcare software and medical-device regulations.

### Workflow Integration

AI must fit into the existing clinical workflow.

### Equity

AI should not increase healthcare disparities.

### Transparency

Users should have meaningful information about how an AI system generates its outputs.

### Accountability

There should be clear responsibility for decisions involving AI systems.

### Model Drift

Performance can change when the system is deployed in new populations or environments.

